\hich\af1\dbch\af16\loch\f1 
ideo board, graphics accelerator, graphics adapter, or graphics card). However, because every system is different, you may occasionally encounter graphics problems. Usually there is a simple solution for getting the graphics to look better. See Section 4 
\hich\af1\dbch\af16\loch\f1 f\hich\af1\dbch\af16\loch\f1 or issues affecting specific 3D video cards.
