You may also be able to find out exactly what driver versions are being used for all audio, game contro\hich\af1\dbch\af16\loch\f1 ller, video, and other multimedia hardware by using the DirectX Diagnostic Tool. To do so, click Start, click Run, type }{
\b \hich\af1\dbch\af16\loch\f1 dxdiag}{\hich\af1\dbch\af16\loch\f1  at the command prompt, and then click OK.
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\fs20\cgrid \loch\af3\dbch\af16\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}}\pard \fi-360\li360\widctlpar\jclisttab\tx360\ls7\adjustright {\hich\af1\dbch\af16\loch\f1 For a partial list of card manufacturer Web sites, see Section 9 at the end of this d
\hich\af1\dbch\af16\loch\f1 ocument.
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\s22 \fs20\cgrid \loch\af3\dbch\af16\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}}\pard\plain \s22\fi-360\li360\nowidctlpar\jclisttab\tx360\ls7\adjustright \b\f15\fs20\cgrid {\hich\af1\dbch\af16\loch\f1 Retail vs. reference drivers.}{\b0\f1 
 This document includes references to \ldblquote retail\rdblquote  and \ldblquote reference\rdblquote  drivers. \line \line }{\b0\i\f1 Reference drivers }{\b0\f1 
are released by the chipset manufacturers for use by specific cards (e.g., Nvidia releases reference drivers for video cards using the Nvidia GeForce 256 chipset).\line \line }{\b0\i\f1 Retail drivers }{\b0\f1 
are released by the card manufacturers who use a specific chipset (e.g., Creative Labs releases drivers for the Annihilator Pro video card, which uses the Nvidia GeForce 256 chipset).\line \line So, how do you 
determine whether to update your drivers, and which ones to update them to?\line \line Drivers are constantly being updated and improved (even as new bugs may potentially be introduced). So it\rquote 
s usually a good idea to try the most recently released reference driver from your card\rquote s chipset manufacturer if you are encountering problems using the drivers supplied by the card\rquote s manufacturer.\line \line 
Often, the chipset manufacturers \ldblquote lead the way\rdblquote  with improvements in reference drivers that are later incorporated by the card manufacturer\rquote 
s retail drivers. Reference drivers may not have all the capabilities of retail drivers (e.g., TV Out), but they can significantly increase the quality of your display and increase the compatibility of your video card with games and other programs.\line 
\line In Sections 4 and 5 we make specific recommendations about which driver to update to, but it\rquote s often a good idea to check your card\rquote s chipset manufacturer\rquote s Web site for the latest updated reference driver as well.
