If you are using a computer with integrated video cards/devices that are disabled, these cards/devices may appear as available in the Select a 3-D Renderer dialog box that is displayed when you star
t Motocross Madness 2. (If you do not see this dialog box when you start the game, confirm that the Show 3-D Renderer Selector at Startup checkbox is selected \endash on the Advanced Options screen\endash and then restart Motocross Madness 2.)
